graph TB
    subgraph "Feast Module Operator"
        direction TB
        CLI["Cobra CLI<br/>/manager"]
        Controller["FeastOperator Controller<br/>controller-runtime"]
        Reconciler["ODH Reconciler Framework<br/>opendatahub-operator/v2"]
        KustomizeAction["Kustomize Action<br/>Manifest Rendering"]
        DeployAction["Deploy Action<br/>Ordered Apply + Cache"]
        GCAction["GC Action<br/>Garbage Collection"]
        Finalizer["Finalizer<br/>ClusterRole/Binding Cleanup"]
        MetricsServer["Metrics Server<br/>8443/HTTPS"]
        HealthProbes["Health Probes<br/>8081/HTTP"]
        ConfigLoader["Viper Config<br/>Env + ConfigMap"]

        CLI --> Controller
        Controller --> Reconciler
        Reconciler --> KustomizeAction
        Reconciler --> DeployAction
        Reconciler --> GCAction
        Controller --> Finalizer
        CLI --> MetricsServer
        CLI --> HealthProbes
        CLI --> ConfigLoader
    end

    FeastOperatorCR["FeastOperator CR<br/>components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1<br/>Cluster-scoped"]
    PlatformConfigMap["Platform ConfigMap<br/>Version Configuration"]
    CRDs["CustomResourceDefinitions<br/>Component Detection"]

    FeastOperatorCR -->|watched by| Controller
    PlatformConfigMap -->|watched by| Controller
    CRDs -->|watched by| Controller

    subgraph "Managed Resources"
        direction TB
        Deployments["Deployments"]
        Services["Services"]
        ServiceAccounts["ServiceAccounts"]
        ConfigMaps["ConfigMaps"]
        RBAC["ClusterRoles &<br/>ClusterRoleBindings"]
        Jobs["Jobs"]
        ServiceMonitors["ServiceMonitors"]
    end

    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| Deployments
    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| Services
    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| ServiceAccounts
    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| ConfigMaps
    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| RBAC
    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| Jobs
    DeployAction -->|creates/manages| ServiceMonitors

    K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS"]
    FeastCR["Feast FeatureStore CR<br/>feast.dev"]
    KubeflowNB["Kubeflow Notebooks<br/>kubeflow.org"]
    PrometheusOp["prometheus-operator"]
    OpenShiftRoutes["OpenShift Routes"]

    Controller -->|resource operations| K8sAPI
    Controller -->|watches| FeastCR
    Controller -->|watches| KubeflowNB
    Controller -->|manages| PrometheusOp
    Controller -->|watches| OpenShiftRoutes

